    "type": "fixed",
    "target": "all",
    "dist": 0.6,
    "height": 0.3,
    "yawDeg": -8
   },
   "desc": "The family in Canaan: tents and sheep. Old Jacob holds out a wonderful striped coat; young Joseph puts it on and twirls. His big brother watches, arms folded.",
   "t0": 0.0,
   "t1": 27.56,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "",
    "edge": "origin",
    "dt": 0.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "S02",
   "title_zh": "奇怪的梦",
   "title_en": "Strange dreams",
   "camera": {
    "type": "fixed",
    "target": "joseph",
    "dist": 0.6,
    "height": 0.22,
    "yawDeg": 20
   },
   "desc": "Joseph tells his dreams, acting them out. A picture cloud appears over his head: eleven sheaves bowing to one, then the sun, moon and eleven stars. The brother's ears go red.",
   "t0": 27.56,
   "t1": 50.87,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_04",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.4
   }
  },
  {
