 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "js_01",
   "t": 1.45,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.28,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:3",
   "zh": "很久以前，雅各有十二个儿子。他最疼的，是小儿子约瑟。",
   "en": "Long ago, Jacob had twelve sons. And the one he loved most of all was young Joseph.",
   "dir": "storyteller opening, warm; fond on 最疼的 / 'loved most of all'",
   "dur": 9.23,
   "pre": 0.25,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "",
    "edge": "origin",
    "dt": 1.45
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_02",
   "t": 11.28,
   "who": "jacob",
   "voice": "jacob",
   "maxSec": 7.19,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:3",
   "zh": "约瑟，来！爸爸给你做了一件新衣服，你看——五颜六色的！",
   "en": "Joseph, come here! Father has made you a new coat. Look... all the colours of the rainbow!",
   "dir": "an old, loving father, a little husky, delighted with his present; a happy chuckle",
   "dur": 7.14,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_01",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_03",
   "t": 18.92,
   "who": "joseph",
   "voice": "joseph",
   "maxSec": 3.32,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:3",
   "zh": "哇，太漂亮了！谢谢爸爸！",
   "en": "Wow, it's beautiful! Thank you, Father!",
   "dir": "a bright boy of seventeen, thrilled, a laugh in the voice",
   "dur": 3.27,
   "pre": 0.2,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_02",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.5
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_04",
   "t": 22.79,
   "who": "brother",
   "voice": "brother",
   "maxSec": 4.42,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:4",
   "zh": "哼，又是他。爸爸什么好东西都给他！",
   "en": "Hmph. Him again. Father gives him all the good things!",
   "dir": "muttering to himself, jealous, sour; a real 哼",
   "dur": 4.37,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_03",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_05",
   "t": 28.56,
   "who": "joseph",
   "voice": "joseph",
   "maxSec": 6.63,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:5-7",
   "zh": "哥哥，我做了一个梦！我们在田里捆麦子，你们的麦捆，都向我的麦捆鞠躬呢！",
   "en": "Brothers, I had a dream! We were tying up bundles of wheat in the field, and all your bundles bowed down to mine!",
   "dir": "eager, innocent, no idea he is annoying anyone; quick and bright",
   "dur": 6.58,
   "pre": 1.0,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_04",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_06",
   "t": 35.74,
   "who": "brother",
   "voice": "brother",
   "maxSec": 5.34,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:8",
   "zh": "什么？你是说，我们要向你下拜？做梦！",
   "en": "What? You mean WE are going to bow down to YOU? Dream on!",
   "dir": "outraged, voice rising; snaps 做梦 / 'Dream on'",
   "dur": 5.29,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_05",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_07",
   "t": 41.73,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 8.79,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:9-11",
   "zh": "约瑟又梦见太阳、月亮和十一颗星星，都向他下拜。哥哥们更生气了。",
   "en": "Then Joseph dreamed that the sun, the moon and eleven stars all bowed down to him. His brothers were angrier than ever.",
   "dir": "a little amused, then lower and worried on 更生气了 / 'angrier than ever'",
   "dur": 8.74,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_06",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_08",
   "t": 53.67,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 7.68,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:23-24",
   "zh": "有一天，哥哥们抢走了约瑟的彩衣，把他丢进一个干井里。",
   "en": "One day, the brothers grabbed Joseph's beautiful coat and dropped him into a dry well.",
   "dir": "serious but gentle, not frightening; slower",
   "dur": 7.63,
   "pre": 2.8,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_07",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 3.2
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_09",
   "t": 61.8,
   "who": "joseph",
   "voice": "joseph",
   "maxSec": 2.05,
   "ref": "Genesis 42:21",
   "zh": "哥哥！别丢下我！",
   "en": "Brothers! Please don't leave me!",
   "dir": "calling up from the well, frightened and pleading; short",
   "dur": 2.0,
   "pre": 0.2,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_08",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.5
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_10",
   "t": 65.2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 13.46,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:25-28",
   "zh": "这时来了一队骆驼商人。哥哥们收了二十块银子，就把约瑟卖了。商人把他带去了很远很远的埃及。",
   "en": "Just then some traders came by with their camels. The brothers took twenty pieces of silver and sold Joseph. The traders took him far, far away, to Egypt.",
   "dir": "matter-of-fact, sad underneath; long and far on 很远很远 / 'far, far away'",
   "dur": 13.41,
   "pre": 1.0,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_09",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_11",
   "t": 79.41,
   "who": "jacob",
   "voice": "jacob",
   "maxSec": 4.02,
   "ref": "Genesis 37:34-35",
   "zh": "我的约瑟……我的孩子不见了……",
   "en": "My Joseph... my boy is gone...",
   "dir": "an old man's quiet weeping; broken, very soft; not wailing",
   "dur": 3.97,
   "pre": 0.5,
   "post": 0.8,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_10",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_12",
   "t": 84.78,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 10.5,
   "ref": "Genesis 39:1-20",
   "zh": "在埃及，约瑟做了仆人。他干活又认真又诚实。可是有人冤枉了他，把他关进了监牢。",
   "en": "In Egypt, Joseph became a servant. He worked hard and he was honest. But someone told a lie about him, and he was put in prison.",
   "dir": "steady; proud of him on 又认真又诚实; a sigh on 关进了监牢 / 'put in prison'",
   "dur": 10.45,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_11",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_13",
   "t": 96.03,
   "who": "joseph",
   "voice": "joseph",
   "maxSec": 7.03,
   "ref": "Genesis 39:21-23",
   "zh": "上帝啊，我没有做错事。可我知道，你还和我在一起。",
   "en": "Dear God, I didn't do anything wrong. But I know You are still with me.",
   "dir": "quiet, a little older now; sad but trusting; no self-pity",
   "dur": 6.98,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_12",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_14",
   "t": 103.51,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 4.95,
   "ref": "Genesis 39:21",
   "zh": "没错。就算在监牢里，上帝也和约瑟在一起。",
   "en": "And He was. Even in prison, God was with Joseph.",
   "dir": "warm and sure, like a hand on the shoulder",
   "dur": 4.9,
   "pre": 0.2,
   "post": 0.6,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_13",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.5
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_15",
   "t": 110.81,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 15.64,
   "ref": "Genesis 41:1-4",
   "zh": "一天夜里，埃及的国王法老做了个怪梦：七头肥肥的牛从河里上来，接着七头瘦瘦的牛，把肥牛吃掉了！",
   "en": "One night Pharaoh, the king of Egypt, had a strange dream. Seven fat cows came up out of the river. Then came seven skinny cows... and they ate the fat cows right up!",
   "dir": "spooky-funny bedtime voice; round on 肥肥的 / 'fat', thin on 瘦瘦的 / 'skinny'; a gasp on 吃掉了",
   "dur": 15.59,
   "pre": 1.8,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_14",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_16",
   "t": 129.5,
   "who": "pharaoh",
   "voice": "pharaoh",
   "maxSec": 7.49,
   "ref": "Genesis 41:7-8",
   "zh": "啊！牛吃牛？麦穗吃麦穗？这是什么意思？谁能告诉我！",
   "en": "Aah! Cows eating cows? Grain eating grain? What does it mean? Somebody tell me!",
   "dir": "a grand king in a panic, comic; high and flustered; bossy on the last sentence",
   "dur": 7.44,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_15",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 3.1
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_17",
   "t": 139.74,
   "who": "pharaoh",
   "voice": "pharaoh",
   "maxSec": 2.54,
   "ref": "Genesis 41:15",
   "zh": "听说你会解梦？",
   "en": "I hear you can tell what dreams mean?",
   "dir": "hopeful, leaning forward; a king who has not slept",
   "dur": 2.49,
   "pre": 2.4,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_16",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_18",
   "t": 142.83,
   "who": "joseph",
   "voice": "joseph",
   "maxSec": 4.7,
   "ref": "Genesis 41:16",
   "zh": "王啊，我不会。可是上帝会，他会告诉您。",
   "en": "No, Your Majesty, I can't. But God can, and He will tell you.",
   "dir": "humble and calm; clear and sure on 上帝会 / 'God can'",
   "dur": 4.65,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_17",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_19",
   "t": 148.48,
   "who": "joseph",
   "voice": "joseph",
   "maxSec": 9.72,
   "ref": "Genesis 41:25-36",
   "zh": "七头肥牛，是七个大丰收的年头。七头瘦牛，是七个闹饥荒的年头。请您趁丰收的时候，把粮食存起来！",
   "en": "The seven fat cows are seven years with plenty of food. The seven skinny cows are seven years with no food at all. So store up grain in the good years, while you can!",
   "dir": "clear, like a kind teacher counting on his fingers; urgent and helpful at the end",
   "dur": 9.67,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_18",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_20",
   "t": 158.95,
   "who": "pharaoh",
   "voice": "pharaoh",
   "maxSec": 6.75,
   "ref": "Genesis 41:38-41",
   "zh": "太聪明了！上帝和你在一起。从今天起，你来管理整个埃及！",
   "en": "How wise! God is with you. From today, you shall be in charge of all Egypt!",
   "dir": "overjoyed, booming, generous; arms wide on the last sentence",
   "dur": 6.7,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_19",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_21",
   "t": 171.15,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 7.5,
   "ref": "Genesis 41:47-49",
   "zh": "丰收的七年里，约瑟把粮食存得满满的，像海边的沙那么多。",
   "en": "For seven good years Joseph stored up grain, heaps and heaps of it, like the sand on the seashore.",
   "dir": "busy and bright; big on 满满的 / 'heaps and heaps'",
   "dur": 7.45,
   "pre": 1.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_20",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 5.5
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_22",
   "t": 179.6,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 11.64,
   "ref": "Genesis 41:54-42:3",
   "zh": "后来，饥荒真的来了，到处都没有饭吃。只有埃及有粮食。雅各就叫儿子们去埃及买粮。",
   "en": "Then the hungry years really came. There was no food anywhere... except in Egypt. So Jacob sent his sons to Egypt to buy grain.",
   "dir": "dry and tired, then a lift of hope on 只有埃及有粮食 / 'except in Egypt'",
   "dur": 11.59,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_21",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_23",
   "t": 193.29,
   "who": "brother",
   "voice": "brother",
   "maxSec": 6.15,
   "ref": "Genesis 42:6-7",
   "zh": "大人，求求您，卖一点粮食给我们吧。我们一家人都快饿坏了。",
   "en": "My lord, please, sell us a little grain. Our whole family is so hungry.",
   "dir": "humble, tired, nothing left of the old sneer; head down",
   "dur": 6.1,
   "pre": 1.8,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_22",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.1
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_24",
   "t": 200.19,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.46,
   "ref": "Genesis 42:8-9",
   "zh": "约瑟一眼就认出了哥哥们。可他们认不出约瑟。约瑟想起了小时候做的那个梦。",
   "en": "Joseph knew his brothers at once. But they did not know him. And Joseph remembered the dream he had as a boy.",
   "dir": "hushed, a secret shared with the child; wonder on 那个梦 / 'the dream'",
   "dur": 9.41,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_23",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_25",
   "t": 210.4,
   "who": "joseph",
   "voice": "joseph",
   "maxSec": 2.63,
   "ref": "Genesis 43:27",
   "zh": "你们的爸爸……他还好吗？",
   "en": "Your father... is he well?",
   "dir": "trying to sound like a stranger, but the voice shakes; very soft",
   "dur": 2.58,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.6,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_24",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_26",
