    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_28",
   "t": 226.67,
   "who": "joseph",
   "voice": "joseph",
   "maxSec": 8.68,
   "ref": "Genesis 45:5-8; 50:20",
   "zh": "别怕，别难过。你们本来想害我，可是上帝把坏事变成了好事，好救许多人的命。",
   "en": "Don't be afraid, and don't be sad. You meant to hurt me, but God turned it into something good, to save many lives.",
   "dir": "the heart of the story: gentle, completely forgiving, steady; slow on 把坏事变成了好事",
   "dur": 8.63,
   "pre": 0.8,
   "post": 0.5,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "js_27",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.2
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "js_29",
   "t": 238.4,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 5.37,
   "ref": "Genesis 46:5-7, 46:29",
   "zh": "约瑟把爸爸和全家人都接到了埃及。",
   "en": "Then Joseph brought his father and the whole family to live in Egypt.",
   "dir": "glad, a little out of breath with happiness",
